  "body": "# IMPRESSIVE TWO-STOREY RELOCATABLE HOME – $220,000 COMPLETE PACKAGE\r\n\r\n**3 BEDROOMS | 2 BATHROOMS | GENEROUS LIVING | RELOCATION & FOUNDATIONS INCLUDED**\r\n\r\nLooking for a substantial family home without the expense of building a brand-new two-storey house?\r\n\r\nThis impressive three-bedroom, two-bathroom relocatable home offers generous living space across two levels and represents an excellent opportunity for buyers looking to establish a quality home on their own property.\r\n\r\nWell maintained and presented in great condition, this home offers a practical layout with plenty of room for comfortable family living.\r\n\r\nAnd the best part? **Our $220,000 package includes the house, transport, crane work and new foundations, subject to conditions.**\r\n\r\n### PROPERTY FEATURES\r\n\r\n- 3 bedrooms\r\n- 2 bathrooms\r\n- Spacious two-storey design\r\n- Generous family living areas\r\n- Kitchen and dining spaces\r\n- Separate living and entertaining areas\r\n- Aluminium joinery\r\n- Well-maintained interior and exterior\r\n- Attractive residential design\r\n- Excellent potential for a family or lifestyle property\r\n\r\n### WHAT'S INCLUDED IN THE $220,000 PACKAGE?\r\n\r\nTR Building Removals will manage the major stages of relocating this two-storey home.\r\n\r\n**YOUR PACKAGE INCLUDES:**\r\n\r\n? Purchase of the complete house\r\n\r\n? Preparation of the house for relocation\r\n\r\n? Separation of the upper storey for transportation\r\n\r\n? Crane lifting of the upper storey\r\n\r\n? Transportation of the house to your destination site\r\n\r\n? Crane placement of the upper storey back onto the lower structure\r\n\r\n? New standard foundations to NZS 3604 requirements\r\n\r\n? Positioning and securing the house onto its foundations\r\n\r\n**ALL INCLUDED FOR $220,000 – CONDITIONS APPLY.**\r\n\r\n### WHY CHOOSE THIS HOME?\r\n\r\nTwo-storey relocatable homes offer an excellent opportunity to secure substantial living space without starting a new build from scratch.\r\n\r\nIdeal for families wanting extra room, lifestyle properties or buyers looking for an established home with character and generous proportions.\r\n\r\nWith the major relocation and foundation work included in the package, TR Building Removals can help simplify what would otherwise be a complex project.\r\n\r\n### RELOCATION CONDITIONS\r\n\r\nFinal pricing and relocation arrangements are subject to:\r\n\r\n- Delivery location and transport route\r\n- Suitable site access for trucks and cranes\r\n- Ground conditions and foundation requirements\r\n- Site-specific engineering and consent requirements\r\n- Any additional work outside the agreed relocation package\r\n\r\nAny additional works will be discussed and quoted where required.\r\n\r\n### VIEWING BY APPOINTMENT ONLY\r\n\r\nThis home is available for private viewing by prior arrangement.\r\n\r\nContact **TR BUILDING REMOVALS** via email to organise a suitable viewing time, discuss the relocation process or request further information.\r\n\r\n**ASKING PRICE: $220,000 – RELOCATION, CRANE WORK & FOUNDATIONS INCLUDED.**\r\n\r\n### SEARCH KEYWORDS\r\n\r\nRelocatable house, relocatable home, two storey house, two-storey relocatable, double storey house, house for removal, house removal, removal house, transportable home, transportable house, 3 bedroom house, three bedroom home, two bathroom house, large family home, affordable family home, house movers, building removals, house transport, house relocation, crane relocation, house lifting, house and land, second hand house, lifestyle block home, rural property, investment property, Auckland relocatable houses, North Shore, Milford, Northland, Whangarei, Rodney, Warkworth, Kerikeri, Bay of Islands.",
